  <data name="FinishNextStepAttended" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>When the Linux installer starts, it will check the Home Assistant OS image on the USB, look online for a newer verified image, and use the newest valid option. It will then show the internal drives it can install to, ask you to choose the target disk, show a clear erase warning, write Home Assistant OS, set up boot where possible, and reboot when finished.</value>
